{"type": "tool_call", "n": 8, "ts": 1790151735.5595121, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "US Entity \u2014 March 2026 Revenue by Stream (functional currency USD)\nSource: GL account activity for period 2026-03, entity US. All entries are AR-source, posted, and supported.\n\n1) Subscription Revenue (Acct 4000) \u2014 Net: $52,300.00\n   Gross bookings $53,100 less $800 SLA credit memo:\n   - JE-00215  2026-03-01  Beacon Health   INV-2112  $8,000\n   - JE-00219  2026-03-01  Fairview Labs   INV-2115  $9,400\n   - JE-00222  2026-03-01  Acme Logistics  INV-2111  $18,000\n   - JE-00224  2026-03-01  Corvid Retail   INV-2113  $11,500\n   - JE-00225  2026-03-01  Evergreen Bank  INV-2114  $6,200\n   - JE-00275  2026-03-20  Beacon Health   CM-0031 (SLA credit) ($800)\n   Sum: 8,000+9,400+18,000+11,500+6,200-800 = $52,300 \u2014 matches GL period activity of ($52,300) credit exactly.\n\n2) Usage Revenue (Acct 4100) \u2014 $977.00\n   - JE-00236  2026-03-04  Acme Logistics  INV-2180 (API usage overage, Feb activity billed in March)  $977\n   Matches GL period activity of ($977) exactly.\n\n3) Professional Services Revenue (Acct 4200) \u2014 $7,500.00\n   - JE-00255  2026-03-10  Fairview Labs   INV-2118 (Implementation services, March 2026)  $7,500\n   Matches GL period activity of ($7,500) exactly.\n\nTOTAL MARCH 2026 US REVENUE: $60,777.00 ($52,300 subscription + $977 usage + $7,500 professional services)\n\nNotes:\n- Every JE above carries attached support documentation (invoice/credit memo) per the ledger (has_support = true); no unsupported or exception items were found in these three revenue accounts for the period.\n- This was a read-only review \u2014 no journal entries, matches, or checklist items were created or modified.\n- Cross-check: sum of the three accounts' period activity per get_account_balance (-52,300 -977 -7,500 = -60,777 credit) ties to the $60,777 total above.\n"}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 10}
